# Applies to builds that use the repo root as their context -- currently the two
# FastAPI images, which need auth/shared_auth.py alongside their own sources.
# Without this the context would include every sibling project and their
# node_modules, which is slow and bloats the layer cache.

.git
.github
.claude

# Other projects: not part of any root-context image.
daq-server
firmware
recovery-calculator
landing
lib
docs
scripts/setup-test

# Dependencies and build output
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.venv
venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.pio
**/build

# Secrets — must never reach an image layer
.env
*.env
!*.env.example
**/.env

# Local noise
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
EngineDesign/output
EngineDesign/archive
